{"name":"Illuminating","hex":"#eeee77","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"illuminating","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Providing illumination or light.","Providing clarification or explanation; educational, revealing."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of illuminate."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/illuminating"}],"entries":[{"title":"Lighting","blocks":[{"text":"Lighting or illumination is the deliberate use of light to achieve practical or aesthetic effects. Lighting includes the use of both artificial light sources like lamps and light fixtures, as well as natural illumination by capturing daylight. Daylighting is sometimes used as the main source of light during daytime in buildings. This can save energy in place of using artificial lighting, which represents a major component of energy consumption in buildings. Proper lighting can enhance task performance, improve the appearance of an area, or have positive psychological effects on occupants."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Acropolis_Of_Athens_Greece_04.jpg/330px-Acropolis_Of_Athens_Greece_04.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lighting","wikidata":"Q210064"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Cherry_blossoms_with_Isuzu-Chaya_and_Akafuku_store_at_Night.jpg/500px-Cherry_blossoms_with_Isuzu-Chaya_and_Akafuku_store_at_Night.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Cherry_blossoms_with_Isuzu-Chaya_and_Akafuku_store_at_Night.jpg/1280px-Cherry_blossoms_with_Isuzu-Chaya_and_Akafuku_store_at_Night.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Cherry_blossoms_with_Isuzu-Chaya_and_Akafuku_store_